<title>UK: Daimler says higher dividend possible.</title>
<headline>Daimler says higher dividend possible.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>German industrial conglomerate Daimler-Benz AG said on Thursday that a higher full year dividend was possible if the company maintained its profitability.</p>
<p>&quot;If our profitability continues, then everyone could come to the conclusion that there could be a (dividend) increase,&quot; chief executive officer Juergen Schrempp told a news conference in London.</p>
<p>Last year, Daimler paid 1.10 marks per five-mark share.</p>
<p>--Tony Roddam, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
</text>
